; mildly elevated specific gravity\n- **Blood tests:** creatinine normal; eGFR normal; WBC normal; CRP not elevated\n- **Renal ultrasound:** mild right hydronephrosis; possible small proximal ureteral stone not directly visualized; no renal mass seen\n\n## Preliminary Interpretation\nTaken together, this synthetic picture is **most consistent with a small right-sided ureteral stone** causing **mild obstruction of urine flow**.\n\nSupporting features include:\n- prior history of stones\n- **trace blood** in urine\n- **mild right hydronephrosis** on ultrasound\n\nThe available inputs do **not strongly support active infection**, since:\n- no fever was reported\n- inflammatory markers were not elevated\n- urine infection markers were negative\n\nKidney function appears **preserved**, which is reassuring, and the ultrasound did **not show a renal mass**.\n\n## Red Flags\nUrgent in-person care would be appropriate if any of these occur:\n- **fever or chills**\n- **worsening or severe pain**\n- **persistent vomiting**\n- **difficulty urinating** or marked drop in urine output\n- **visible heavy blood in urine**\n- fainting, worsening weakness, or signs of dehydration\n\n## Suggested Next Steps\n- Arrange **clinical follow-up soon**\n- A clinician may consider **repeat assessment** and decide whether more imaging is needed if symptoms continue or worsen\n- **Hydration status** may be worth reviewing, unless fluid restriction has already been advised\n\n**Tool-used status:** **no** — the Doctor Agent reported that it **attempted** to run the real `llm_distillator` workflow, but it was **not usable in this environment** because the underlying access token had expired.\n\nIf you want, I can now help you:\n1. draft a **fix request** for the expired token issue, or  \n2. prepare a **clean synthetic payload** so you can retry the real `llm_distillator` tool once access is restored.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_021fa6657b4239000169c41aad877481919f1066b5febe5d59\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3393,"output":595,"cacheRead":12800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16788,"cost":{"input":0.0084825,"output":0.008925,"cacheRead":0.0031999999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0206075}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774459563154}}
